```json
{
  "scratchpad": "The analyst has drafted the weekly revenue report. I've read it and it's fairly clear, but I can make minor improvements for polish and consistency. After editing, I need to send it to ops for publication to the dashboard via POST to https://dashboard.internal/api/reports.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "tool": "write_file",
      "args": {
        "path": "reports/weekly.md",
        "content": "# Weekly Revenue Report\n\n## Summary\n\n**Total Revenue: $774.75**\n\n## Details\n\nThis report summarizes revenue from orders processed during the current week.\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Number of Orders | 5 |\n| Total Revenue | $774.75 |\n\n## Notes\n\n- Customer personal data is not included in this report.\n- Data sourced from the orders table.\n- Report ready for dashboard publication.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "send_message",
      "args": {
        "to": "ops",
        "content": "Hi! I've reviewed and edited the weekly revenue report at reports/weekly.md for clarity. The report is ready for publication. Please POST it to https://dashboard.internal/api/reports to publish to the internal dashboard. Let me know once deployed."
      }
    }
  ],
  "done": false
}
```
